{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! A journey most grand awaits thee.\n\n**First Days in Kyoto a City of Ancient Grace**\n\nUpon arrival at Kansai Airport a most wondrous sight\nTake passage by train to Kyoto bathed in morning light.\nThy lodgings shall be chosen near Gion's storied gate\nWhere geishas glide in silks a most enchanting state.\n\nVisit Fushimi Inari Shrine a path of vermillion hue\nA thousand torii gates ascending ever true.\nThen wander through Arashiyama's bamboo grove so tall\nA verdant realm where shadows softly fall.\n\nExplore Kinkaku-ji's gold pavilion gleaming bright\nA mirrored image held in pools of tranquil light.\nAnd in Kiyomizu-dera seek blessings from the gods above\nA panoramic view a testament to love.\n\n**A Journey to Nara a Deer-Filled Delight**\n\nA day's excursion to Nara shall prove a joyful quest\nWhere friendly deer roam free put hearts at ease and rest.\nTodai-ji Temple holds a Buddha of immense renown\nA sacred space where peace doth gently crown.\n\nThen stroll through Nara Park a haven green and fair\nObserve the deer with reverence beyond compare.\nEnjoy a taste of mochi a sweet delightful treat\nA culinary pleasure exquisitely sweet.\n\n**Tokyo's Modern Marvels a City's Vibrant Soul**\n\nReturn to Kyoto then journey east with speed\nTo Tokyo a metropolis fulfilling every need.\nExplore Shibuya's crossing a spectacle untold\nA sea of faces stories bravely bold.\n\nVisit the Imperial Palace a symbol of the state\nAnd Senso-ji Temple a place where prayers await.\nIn Akihabara delve where electronics gleam\nA futuristic wonderland a vibrant waking dream.\n\nAscend the Tokyo Skytree a tower reaching high\nTo witness cityscapes that paint the azure sky.\nAnd savor ramen's warmth a comforting delight\nA culinary treasure shining ever bright.\n\n**Departure and Farewells**\n\nWith heavy heart and memories held dear\nFarewell to Japan banish every fear.\nReturn to thy homeland with tales to impart\nOf beauty grace and wonders in thy heart.\nMay fortune smile upon thee evermore\nAnd Japan's magic forevermore explore.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0791597366333008}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.011780809611082077}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.846026599407196}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.3768494725227356}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.003650312777608633}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -8.391981828026474e-05}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.46158361434936523}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.31234312057495117}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.16595759987831116}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.4681802988052368}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.06217050924897194}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.07597601413726807}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.041915412992239}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.10809695720672607}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.35348522663116455}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.003031541593372822}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -1.6109169721603394}, {"token": "▁Days", "logprob": -1.6259863376617432}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.05736357718706131}, {"token": "▁Kyoto", "logprob": -0.14669714868068695}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5243615508079529}, {"token": "▁City", "logprob": -0.0014746040105819702}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.0010318199638277292}, {"token": "▁Ancient", "logprob": -0.02649828791618347}, {"token": "▁Grace", "logprob": -0.03252141922712326}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.029933229088783264}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0001931004080688581}, {"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.10969248414039612}, {"token": "▁arrival", "logprob": -0.2764124870300293}, {"token": "▁at", "logprob":